{"page":363,"verses":[{"verse_key":"25:33","surah":25,"ayah":33,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَا يَأْتُونَكَ بِمَثَلٍ إِلَّا جِئْنَـٰكَ بِٱلْحَقِّ وَأَحْسَنَ تَفْسِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They cannot put any argument to you without Our bringing you the truth and the best explanation.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"25:33"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَأْتُونَكَ","en_gloss":"they come to you","transliteration":"yatūnaka","verse_key":"25:33"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِمَثَلٍ","en_gloss":"with an example","transliteration":"bimathalin","verse_key":"25:33"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"25:33"},{"pos":5,"ar":"جِئْنَـٰكَ","en_gloss":"We bring you","transliteration":"ji'nāka","verse_key":"25:33"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"the truth","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"25:33"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَأَحْسَنَ","en_gloss":"and (the) best","transliteration":"wa-aḥsana","verse_key":"25:33"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَفْسِيرًا","en_gloss":"explanation","transliteration":"tafsīran","verse_key":"25:33"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٣٣","en_gloss":"(33)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"25:33"}]},{"verse_key":"25:34","surah":25,"ayah":34,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ يُحْشَرُونَ عَلَىٰ وُجُوهِهِمْ إِلَىٰ جَهَنَّمَ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ شَرٌّ مَّكَانًا وَأَضَلُّ سَبِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is those driven [falling], on their faces,to Hell who will be in the worst place- they are the furthest from the right path.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"Those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"25:34"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُحْشَرُونَ","en_gloss":"will be gathered","transliteration":"yuḥ'sharūna","verse_key":"25:34"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"25:34"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وُجُوهِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their faces","transliteration":"wujūhihim","verse_key":"25:34"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"25:34"},{"pos":6,"ar